        "slc_21f8784f70f69cd832d564a88c0f35343a24ffb0511702a3ccf1ef4555f2012c"
      ],
      "text": "The project is a multi-agent marathon simulation built with Google ADK and Gemini in which agents plan a Las Vegas marathon route, simulate weather, traffic, and crowds, and run the race autonomously, communicating over the A2A protocol."
    },
    {
