      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2be368ee9f52def9885fcf0f9be0bac23add654710acc137f00e9a3567bddf3d"
      ],
      "text": "The planner ships in three variants: a base planner, one adding LLM-as-Judge evaluation, and one adding AlloyDB-backed route memory; the simulator runs a tick-based pipeline and spawns runner agents, which come in LLM-powered and deterministic autopilot variants."
    },
