        "slc_b505f1c41157f78698b4132b2098120f265985f0172ad6ce574842d17977ae37"
      ],
      "text": "The frontend boots in Cached mode by default, replaying NDJSON streams recorded from real agent runs so demos do not depend on live LLM calls or the network; Live mode instead talks to agents over WebSockets."
    },
