        "slc_431ab4a4a7bd083e0ea037f89794fde027876b24d1ef645c46ba07687fee886f"
      ],
      "text": "A deterministic runner variant, runner_autopilot, makes the same shape of decisions as the LLM-powered runner with zero API calls, intended as a free baseline for load-testing the simulator."
    },
