        "slc_50ad8f83e7522cc2b1b8a62eb325673e1c16501544aecc948b4fcae88d1930ba"
      ],
      "text": "The simulator runs a SequentialAgent pipeline: pre-race parsing and runner spawning, a LoopAgent race loop of up to 200 ticks, and post-race result compilation; each tick it updates conditions and broadcasts state to runner agents."
    },
