      ],
      "text": "Locally the stack runs on Docker Compose with Redis, a Pub/Sub emulator, and PostgreSQL; in the cloud it deploys to Cloud Run, Vertex AI Agent Engine, AlloyDB, Memorystore Redis, and Pub/Sub."
    },
